  "helpFaq1Q": "How do I reset my password?",
  "helpFaq1A": "You can reset your password from the login screen by tapping 'Forgot Password'. Follow the instructions sent to your registered email or phone.",
  "helpFaq2Q": "Can I change my subscription plan?",
  "helpFaq2A": "Yes, go to Settings > Subscription to view and change your current plan. Changes will take effect from the next billing cycle.",
  "helpFaq3Q": "How do I delete my account?",
  "helpFaq3A": "Go to Settings > Danger Zone > Delete My Account. Follow the verification steps to permanently delete your account.",
  "helpFaq4Q": "Where are my downloaded files?",
  "helpFaq4A": "Downloaded episodes are stored within the app under My Downloads. They are available offline for listening anytime.",
  "helpFaq5Q": "How do I update my profile information?",
  "helpFaq5A": "Go to Profile > Edit Profile to update your name, email, date of birth, and profile picture.",
  "helpFaq6Q": "Why is my audio not playing?",
  "helpFaq6A": "Check your internet connection and try restarting the app. If the issue persists, try clearing the app cache from Settings.",
  "helpFaq7Q": "How do I get a refund?",
  "helpFaq7A": "Contact our support team at support@webrofm.com with your transaction details. We'll process your refund within 5-7 business days.",
  "helpFaq8Q": "How do I report a bug?",
  "helpFaq8A": "You can report bugs through the Contact Us section in Settings. Please include steps to reproduce the issue and your device information.",
